  <issue>
  Refactoring of password recovery system
Proposed changes:

- we don't have mutations for password recovery and account activation
- mutation which reset password should also return JWT token so user don't need to pass login/password twice (usually after password change user want to access page)
- for password recovery we are encoding user pk (`urlsafe_base64_encode(force_bytes(user.pk))`) which is not good practice (exposing database ids ). Much better would be using account email for that.
- mutation for password reset should have url for recovery view as additional field - GraphQL API does not know how routing in PWA looks like so backend cant ATM attach valid URL ino emai

Contact me if you need more background for why we need to include those changes
  </issue>
  
